{"html_text": {"ja420:0.1": "<article id='ja420'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja420:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja420:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja420:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja420:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja420:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja420:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja420:10.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja420:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja420:0.2": "Aṭṭhakanipāta ", "ja420:0.3": "Kaccānivagga ", "ja420:0.4": "4. Sumaṅgalajātaka ", "ja420:1.1": "“Bhusamhi kuddhoti avekkhiyāna, ", "ja420:1.2": "Na tāva daṇḍaṁ paṇayeyya issaro; ", "ja420:1.3": "Aṭṭhānaso appatirūpamattano, ", "ja420:1.4": "Parassa dukkhāni bhusaṁ udīraye. ", "ja420:2.1": "Yato ca jāneyya pasādamattano, ", "ja420:2.2": "Atthaṁ niyuñjeyya parassa dukkaṭaṁ; ", "ja420:2.3": "Tadāyamatthoti sayaṁ avekkhiya, ", "ja420:2.4": "Athassa daṇḍaṁ sadisaṁ nivesaye. ", "ja420:3.1": "Na cāpi jhāpeti paraṁ na attanaṁ, ", "ja420:3.2": "Amucchito yo nayate nayānayaṁ; ", "ja420:3.3": "Yo daṇḍadhāro bhavatīdha issaro, ", "ja420:3.4": "Sa vaṇṇagutto siriyā na dhaṁsati. ", "ja420:4.1": "Ye khattiyā se anisammakārino, ", "ja420:4.2": "Paṇenti daṇḍaṁ sahasā pamucchitā; ", "ja420:4.3": "Avaṇṇasaṁyutā jahanti jīvitaṁ, ", "ja420:4.4": "Ito vimuttāpi ca yanti duggatiṁ. ", "ja420:5.1": "Dhamme ca ye ariyappavedite ratā, ", "ja420:5.2": "Anuttarā te vacasā manasā kammunā ca; ", "ja420:5.3": "Te santisoraccasamādhisaṇṭhitā, ", "ja420:5.4": "Vajanti lokaṁ dubhayaṁ tathāvidhā. ", "ja420:6.1": "Rājāhamasmi narapamadānamissaro, ", "ja420:6.2": "Sacepi kujjhāmi ṭhapemi attanaṁ; ", "ja420:6.3": "Nisedhayanto janataṁ tathāvidhaṁ, ", "ja420:6.4": "Paṇemi daṇḍaṁ anukampa yoniso”. ", "ja420:7.1": "“Sirī ca lakkhī ca taveva khattiya, ", "ja420:7.2": "Janādhipa mā vijahi kudācanaṁ; ", "ja420:7.3": "Akkodhano niccapasannacitto, ", "ja420:7.4": "Anīgho tuvaṁ vassasatāni pālaya. ", "ja420:8.1": "Guṇehi etehi upeta khattiya, ", "ja420:8.2": "Ṭhitamariyavattī suvaco akodhano; ", "ja420:8.3": "Sukhī anuppīḷa pasāsamediniṁ, ", "ja420:8.4": "Ito vimuttopi ca yāhi suggatiṁ. ", "ja420:9.1": "Evaṁ sunītena subhāsitena, ", "ja420:9.2": "Dhammena ñāyena upāyaso nayaṁ; ", "ja420:9.3": "Nibbāpaye saṅkhubhitaṁ mahājanaṁ, ", "ja420:9.4": "Mahāva megho salilena medinin”ti. ", "ja420:10.1": "Sumaṅgalajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja420:0.1": "", "ja420:0.2": "", "ja420:0.3": "", "ja420:0.4": "", "ja420:1.1": "Bhusamhi → bhusa hi (bj); bhusampi (mr) ", "ja420:1.2": "", "ja420:1.3": "", "ja420:1.4": "", "ja420:2.1": "", "ja420:2.2": "", "ja420:2.3": "", "ja420:2.4": "", "ja420:3.1": "", "ja420:3.2": "", "ja420:3.3": "", "ja420:3.4": "", "ja420:4.1": "", "ja420:4.2": "", "ja420:4.3": "Avaṇṇasaṁyutā → … saṁyuttā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); … yuttāva (mr) ", "ja420:4.4": "", "ja420:5.1": "", "ja420:5.2": "", "ja420:5.3": "", "ja420:5.4": "", "ja420:6.1": "", "ja420:6.2": "", "ja420:6.3": "", "ja420:6.4": "", "ja420:7.1": "", "ja420:7.2": "", "ja420:7.3": "", "ja420:7.4": "", "ja420:8.1": "", "ja420:8.2": "Ṭhitamariyavattī → … vatti (bj); … vutti (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja420:8.3": "anuppīḷa pasāsamediniṁ → anuppīḷa pasāsa medaniṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); anuppīḷaṁ sahasamedaniṁ (mr) ", "ja420:8.4": "", "ja420:9.1": "sunītena → suvinītena (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja420:9.2": "", "ja420:9.3": "", "ja420:9.4": "megho salilena medinin”ti → medaninti (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja420:10.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja420:0.1": "", "ja420:0.2": "", "ja420:0.3": "", "ja420:0.4": "", "ja420:1.1": "ms22J_1702, msdiv27, pts-vp-pli3.441", "ja420:1.2": "", "ja420:1.3": "", "ja420:1.4": "", "ja420:2.1": "bj30.308, ms22J_1703, msdiv28", "ja420:2.2": "", "ja420:2.3": "", "ja420:2.4": "", "ja420:3.1": "ms22J_1704, msdiv29, ndp22.171, sya27.243", "ja420:3.2": "", "ja420:3.3": "", "ja420:3.4": "", "ja420:4.1": "dr27.242, ms22J_1705, msdiv30", "ja420:4.2": "", "ja420:4.3": "", "ja420:4.4": "", "ja420:5.1": "csp1ed22.179, csp2ed22.179, ms22J_1706, msdiv31, pts-vp-pli3.442", "ja420:5.2": "", "ja420:5.3": "", "ja420:5.4": "", "ja420:6.1": "ms22J_1707, msdiv32", "ja420:6.2": "", "ja420:6.3": "", "ja420:6.4": "", "ja420:7.1": "ms22J_1708, msdiv33